<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Revisão - Gerência de Eventos</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0a0f1a; color: #e2e8f0; min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; text-decoration: none; }
    .logo-icon { color: #60a5fa; }
    .topbar-nav a { color: #94a3b8; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .topbar-nav a:hover { color: #e2e8f0; background: rgba(148,163,184,0.1); }
    .session-pill { padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); border-radius: 999px; color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn-logout { background: transparent; color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); font-family: inherit; }
    .btn-secondary { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.12); color: #e2e8f0; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    .main-content { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; }
    .back-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .back-link:hover { color: #e2e8f0; }
    .article-info { margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); }
    .article-info h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .article-info h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .article-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8125rem; }
    .article-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem; }
    .section { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .section h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .section h3 { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .section p { color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .author-list { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .author-list p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .keywords { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    .keyword { background: rgba(96,165,250,0.1); color: #60a5fa; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .review-section { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .review-section h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .form-group label { display: block; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .form-group select, .form-group textarea { width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(15,23,42,0.5); color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.9375rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .form-group select:focus, .form-group textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: #3b82f6; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,0.15); }
    .form-group textarea { min-height: 150px; resize: vertical; }
    .form-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem; padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; border: none; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-approved { background: #059669; color: white; }
    .btn-approved:hover { background: #047857; }
    .btn-rejected { background: #dc2626; color: white; }
    .btn-rejected:hover { background: #b91c1c; }
    .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.1); color: #e2e8f0; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Gerência de Eventos</a>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/reviewer" class="btn btn-secondary">← Voltar</a>
        <% if (userEmail) { %><span class="session-pill"><%= userEmail %></span><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/reviewer/logout" style="display:inline">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout">Sair</button>
        </form>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <a href="/reviewer" class="back-link">← Voltar para meus artigos</a>

    <div class="article-info">
      <h1><%= article.title %></h1>
      <h2><%= article.title_en %></h2>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>📅 <%= new Date(article.date_submitted || article.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></span>
        <span>🏛️ <%= article.event_name %></span>
        <span>👤 <%= article.contributor %></span>
        <span>🧭 <%= article.area || 'Sem trilha definida' %></span>
        <span>🎤 <%= article.type === 'poster' ? 'Pôster' : 'Oral' %></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Autores</h2>
      <div class="author-list">
        <% article.authors.split('\n').forEach(author => { %>
          <p><%= author.trim() %></p>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h3>Resumo</h3>
      <p><%= article.abstract %></p>

      <h3>Palavras-chave</h3>
      <div class="keywords">
        <% article.keywords.split(',').forEach(kw => { %>
          <span class="keyword"><%= kw.trim() %></span>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="review-section">
      <h2>Parecer do Revisor</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #94a3b8;">Seu envio registra uma recomendação individual. A decisão final do artigo continua sob responsabilidade administrativa.</p>
      <form method="POST" action="/reviewer/articles/<%= article.id %>/review">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="recommendation">Recomendação *</label>
          <select id="recommendation" name="recommendation" required>
            <option value="approved">Recomendar aprovação</option>
            <option value="revision_requested">Solicitar revisão</option>
            <option value="rejected">Recomendar rejeição</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="review-notes">Notas da Revisão *</label>
          <textarea id="review-notes" name="review_notes" required placeholder="Forneça suas observações sobre o artigo..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="rejection-reason">Motivo da Rejeição</label>
          <textarea id="rejection-reason" name="rejection_reason" placeholder="Se selecionou 'Rejeitar', explique o motivo..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <a href="/reviewer" class="btn btn-ghost">Cancelar</a>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-approved">Enviar Parecer</button>
          <button type="submit" name="recommendation" value="rejected" class="btn btn-rejected">Recomendar Rejeição</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>&copy; <%= year %> LIGEM.Redes • <%= typeof appVersion !== 'undefined' ? appVersion : 'V0.1' %></footer>
</body>
</html>
